{"id":"technologie","lemma":"technologie","pos":"noun","rank":1732,"glosses":["technology"],"ipa":"/tɛk.nɔ.lɔ.ʒi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ae/Fr-la_technologie.ogg/Fr-la_technologie.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"technologies"},"formAudio":{"technologies":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-technologies.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La technologie peut aider.","en":"Technology can help.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Cette nouvelle technologie semble très prometteuse.","en":"This new technology looks very promising.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"news"},null,{"g":"to seem","l":"sembler"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"promising","l":"prometteur"}]},{"text":"Quels sont les avantages de cette technologie ?","en":"What are the advantages of this technology?","words":[{"g":"which","l":"quel"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"advantage","l":"avantage"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Je suis un peu dépassé par les nouvelles technologies.","en":"I'm a little out of touch with new technology.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"outdated"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"news"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"a little, a bit"]]},{"text":"La technologie s'est améliorée depuis.","en":"Technology has improved since then.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"since"}]}]}